      "message": "But you\u0027ll still get the interrupts fluctuating, no? And we ignore it when the host sleep event isn\u0027t sent? For that matter shouldn\u0027t we query the power_get_host_sleep_state() first?\n\nI also think the scenario you describe is helpful knowledge that should be put in comments here explaining the reasoning.",
