      "message": "Agree to your point. But I didn\u0027t touch this portion of code, as it was there from the time the first s0ix patch was pushed(https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/#/c/307947/5). The only logic I can think of is the signal state in S0. System is in S0 only if SLP_S3\u003dSLP_S0\u003d1. If SLP_S0\u003d1 \u0026\u0026 SLP_S3\u003d0, system is actually in S3. Anyway I will try to find the rational behind the particular logic.",
